@baseUrl = http://localhost:5080

### Health check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Upload a text document
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/documents
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=DocuMindBoundary

--DocuMindBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="sample.txt"
Content-Type: text/plain

DocuMind splits documents into overlapping chunks. Each chunk is embedded and stored in PostgreSQL with pgvector. When you ask a question, the most relevant chunks are sent to the language model, which answers with citations.
--DocuMindBoundary--

### Ask a question (returns 501 until roadmap step 5)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/chat/ask
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "How does DocuMind answer questions?"
}
